<title>USA: LIPA to discuss LILCO proposal Thursday.</title>
<headline>LIPA to discuss LILCO proposal Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Long Island Power Authority board will discuss the proposed takeover of Long Island Lighting Co at its meeting in Hauppauge, N.Y., Thursday, spokesman Seth D. Hulkower said.</p>
<p>The authority said the board would meet at 1000 EDT/1400GMT September 26 in the Radisson Hotel Islandia.</p>
<p>Hulkower declined to release an agenda for the session prior to the meeting.</p>
<p>-- Jim Brumm 212-859-1710.</p>
</text>
